const definitionBody: TextBlockBody[] = [
  'Carpet and rug cleaning is the deep cleaning of soft floor coverings in your home, usually by hot water extraction, which pushes heated water and cleaning solution into the pile under pressure and draws it straight back out with the soil. It lifts the grit, oils, sand and pet hair that vacuuming leaves behind. TLB Cleaning cleans carpet and rugs across the Northern Rivers and the Tweed.',
  'Carpet steam cleaning and hot water extraction are two names for the same method. Rugs are the part people get wrong: a fitted synthetic carpet and a loose wool rug are not the same job, they do not take the same water or the same chemistry, and a rug that is cleaned like carpet is how you end up with shrinkage, bleeding dyes or a browned fringe.',
];

